{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "That is it from this one-sided affair. We hope you enjoyed the coverage. India, Pakistan and Sri Lanka qualify for the next round. If Bangladesh win their game in hand, they take the fourth spot. Do keep an eye on the schedule page. Till then, goodbye and take care!", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:32:18+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Sneh Rana\u00a0wins the Player of the Match award. She says she enjoyed her bowling after a long time. Adds she gets support from the staff and she backs her strength and keeps it very basic. Informs the confidence is high in the team and hopes to keep the momentum going.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:26:31+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Smriti Mandhana, the captain of India Women\u00a0says it is a proud feeling to play the 100th T20I for the country. Adds it is a fun team to play with. Admits Thailand Women\u00a0have played good cricket but credits her bowlers for this performance. Reckons they are looking forward to the next game.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:25:50+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Naruemol Chaiwai, the skipper of Thailand Women\u00a0says\u00a0it was a good experience to play a top-class team but she feels disappointed. Adds they could have played this game much better. Reckons they need to practice more and play more cricket and grab more experience.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:25:15+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "...Presentation coming up...", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:23:53+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "A complete performance by India, the bowlers did most of the job and it was just formalities after that. It was a big toss to win for India and they were ruthless from start to finish. Only one batter of Thailand managed to cross the double-digit mark. It was the spinners who run riot with Sneh Rana\u00a0finishing with three wickets while Deepti Sharma\u00a0and Rajeshwari Gayakwad\u00a0claimed two wickets. A learning curve for Thailand Women\u00a0who showed everyone when they beat Pakistan that they do have the determination but needs more exposure.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:22:55+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "A dominating performance with the ball and bat by India Women! They will certainly finish on top of the table unless Pakistan come up with something miraculous and for Thailand Women, they sit on \u00a0fourth place for now but if Bangladesh win their next game, Thailand will miss out on the semi-final place.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-10T09:13:35+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": 